</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Twas God that brought me to the tree,</l><l>With Christ Himself as meat;</l><l>How precious did that tree become</l><l>When I began to eat.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Lord Himself is food to me,</l><l>He is my life supply;</l><l>He will my pure enjoyment be,</l><l>None else can satisfy.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I freely eat this living tree,</l><l>For eating is the way</l><l>To put God’s life inside of me,</l><l>To live by Him today.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
